{"id":2265,"title":{"romaji":"Planetarian: Chiisana Hoshi no Yume","english":"Planetarian","native":"planetarian～ちいさなほしのゆめ～"},"slug":"planetarian_chiisana_hoshi_no_yume","synopsis":"It is thirty years after the failure of the Space Colonization Program.\nHumanity is nearly extinct. A perpetual and deadly Rain falls on the Earth.\nMen known as \"Junkers\" plunder goods and artifacts from the ruins of civilization.\nOne such Junker sneaks alone into the most dangerous of all ruins -- a \"Sarcophagus City\".\nIn the center of this dead city, he discovers a pre-War planetarium.\nAnd as he enters he is greeted by Hoshino Yumemi, a companion robot.\nWithout a single shred of doubt, she assumes he is the first customer she's had in 30 years.\nShe attempts to show him the stars at once, but the planetarium projector is broken.\nUnable to make heads or tails of her conversation, he ends up agreeing to try and repair the projector ...\n\n(Source: Steam)","format":"ONA","season":"SUMMER","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:25","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 06:30:23","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":33091},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21732},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":12023},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":12085},{"site":"ANN","externalId":18280},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7837},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"AMAZON_PRIME_VIDEO","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":4521,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/Ru5GK87J4P2CjVzczu6efe3YaOW2cgXvFkUVAYg8.jpg"},{"id":4522,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/RdEI5T2oVm8QIIpYS41CwGLn7RWVPy8BcacVMcau.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":7,"name":"David Production","slug":"david_production"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":432,"name":"Planetarian","slug":"planetarian"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":6863,"slug":"ED1","type":"ED","sequence":1,"song":{"id":6863,"title":{"romaji":"Twinkle Starlight","native":n